# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Physics Demo — 3D Maze
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

令 R = 8.0
令 GRAVITY = 22.0
令 DAMPING = 0.99
令 ELASTICITY = 0.80
令 DT = 0.0167
令 MOVE_ACCEL = 250.0
令 MAX_CHARGE = 11.0
令 CHARGE_RATE = 14.0
令 WALL_HEIGHT = 60.0
令 WALL_WIDTH = 20.0

bind start = do {
    open_fullscreen("3D Maze")
    capture_mouse()
    set_ambient(0.2)

    ระดับเสียง(0.45)
    เสียงโทน(0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 4.0, 200.0, 0.06, 0.5, 0.02)

    # Ball state
    令 bx = 0.0
    令 by = 0.0
    令 bz = 0.0
    令 vx = 0.0
    令 vy = 0.0
    令 vz = 0.0

    令 FR = 0
    令 lastBounce = -99
    令 charge = 0.0
    令 spaceWasDown = 0

    # Camera state
    令 cam_orbit = 0.0
    令 cam_pitch = 0.5
    令 cam_dist = 100.0

    ขณะที่ หน้าต่างเปิดอยู่() {
        เติม(10, 5, 15)

        # ── Physics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 vy = vy + GRAVITY * DT

        令 vx = vx * DAMPING
        令 vy = vy * DAMPING
        令 vz = vz * DAMPING

        令 bx = bx + vx * DT
        令 by = by + vy * DT
        令 bz = bz + vz * DT

        令 hit = 0

        # ── Maze collision (walls defined as rectangles) ──────────────────────
        # Outer boundary walls
        if bx < -150.0 + R { 令 bx = -150.0 + R  令 vx = 0.0 - vx * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }
        if bx > 150.0 - R { 令 bx = 150.0 - R  令 vx = 0.0 - vx * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }
        if bz < -150.0 + R { 令 bz = -150.0 + R  令 vz = 0.0 - vz * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }
        if bz > 150.0 - R { 令 bz = 150.0 - R  令 vz = 0.0 - vz * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }

        # Floor and ceiling
        if by < 0.0 - 100.0 + R { 令 by = 0.0 - 100.0 + R  令 vy = 0.0 - vy * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }
        if by > 100.0 - R { 令 by = 100.0 - R  令 vy = 0.0 - vy * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 }

        # Maze walls (interior barriers)
        # Wall 1: vertical corridor at x=50
        if bx > 45.0 - R { if bx < 55.0 + R { if bz > -60.0 { if bz < 60.0 { 令 bx = 45.0 - R  令 vx = 0.0 - vx * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 } } } }

        # Wall 2: horizontal at z=-40
        if bz > -45.0 - R { if bz < -35.0 + R { if bx > -80.0 { if bx < 80.0 { 令 bz = -45.0 - R  令 vz = 0.0 - vz * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 } } } }

        # Wall 3: vertical at x=-70
        if bx > -75.0 - R { if bx < -65.0 + R { if bz > -100.0 { if bz < 0.0 { 令 bx = -75.0 - R  令 vx = 0.0 - vx * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 } } } }

        # Wall 4: horizontal at z=80
        if bz > 75.0 - R { if bz < 85.0 + R { if bx > -120.0 { if bx < 100.0 { 令 bz = 75.0 - R  令 vz = 0.0 - vz * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 } } } }

        # Wall 5: vertical at x=100
        if bx > 95.0 - R { if bx < 105.0 + R { if bz > 0.0 { if bz < 120.0 { 令 bx = 95.0 - R  令 vx = 0.0 - vx * ELASTICITY  令 hit = 1 } } } }

        若 hit > 0 { 令 lastBounce = FR }
        令 grounded = 0
        若 by > 100.0 - R - 1.0 { 令 grounded = 1 }

        # ── Input ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        若 key_down("w") { 令 vz = vz + MOVE_ACCEL * DT }
        若 key_down("s") { 令 vz = vz - MOVE_ACCEL * DT }
        若 key_down("a") { 令 vx = vx - MOVE_ACCEL * DT }
        若 key_down("d") { 令 vx = vx + MOVE_ACCEL * DT }

        # ── Jump ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 spaceNow = 0
        若 key_down("space") { 令 spaceNow = 1 }

        若 spaceNow > 0 {
            若 grounded > 0 {
                令 charge = charge + CHARGE_RATE * DT
                若 charge > MAX_CHARGE { 令 charge = MAX_CHARGE }
            }
        } 否则 {
            若 spaceWasDown > 0 {
                若 charge > 0.01 {
                    令 vy = vy - charge
                    令 lastLaunch = FR
                }
                令 charge = 0.0
            }
        }
        令 spaceWasDown = spaceNow

        # ── Derived quantities ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 speed = sqrt(vx*vx + vy*vy + vz*vz)
        令 hNorm = (100.0 - by) / 200.0

        # ── Physics-encoded audio ──────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 sinceHit = FR - lastBounce
        令 impact = 0.0
        若 sinceHit < 6 { 令 impact = (6 - sinceHit) * 24.0 }

        令 freq = 140.0 + hNorm * 200.0 + impact + speed * 20.0
        令 amp = 0.04 + speed * 0.06
        令 pan = bx / 150.0
        เสียงโทน(0, bx, by, bz, 4.0, freq, amp, pan, 0.02)

        # ── Lights ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        clear_lights()
        add_light(sin(FR*0.005)*40.0, 30.0, cos(FR*0.003)*40.0, 1.0, 0.9, 0.8, 2.5, 100.0)
        add_light(-50.0, 20.0, -50.0, 0.6, 0.7, 1.0, 1.0, 50.0)
        add_light(bx, by + 20.0, bz, 0.8, 0.5, 0.9, 0.9, 30.0)

        # ── Camera positioning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 cam_x = bx + cam_dist * cos(cam_pitch) * sin(cam_orbit)
        令 cam_y = by + cam_dist * sin(cam_pitch) * 0.7 + 30.0
        令 cam_z = bz + cam_dist * cos(cam_pitch) * cos(cam_orbit)

        令 look_dx = bx - cam_x
        令 look_dy = by - cam_y
        令 look_dz = bz - cam_z
        令 look_len = sqrt(look_dx*look_dx + look_dy*look_dy + look_dz*look_dz) + 0.001

        令 look_dx = look_dx / look_len
        令 look_dy = look_dy / look_len
        令 look_dz = look_dz / look_len

        令 cam_yaw = atan2(look_dz, look_dx)
        令 cam_pitch_angle = atan2(look_dy, sqrt(look_dx*look_dx + look_dz*look_dz))

        令 cry = cos(cam_yaw)
        令 sry = sin(cam_yaw)
        令 crx = cos(cam_pitch_angle)
        令 srx = sin(cam_pitch_angle)

        set_camera(cry, sry, crx, srx)
        set_camera_pos(cam_x, cam_y, cam_z)

        # ── Camera controls ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        若 key_down("left") { 令 cam_orbit = cam_orbit - 0.05 }
        若 key_down("right") { 令 cam_orbit = cam_orbit + 0.05 }
        若 key_down("up") { 令 cam_pitch = cam_pitch + 0.03 }
        若 key_down("down") { 令 cam_pitch = cam_pitch - 0.03 }
        若 key_down("z") { 令 cam_dist = cam_dist - 3.0   若 cam_dist < 30.0 { 令 cam_dist = 30.0 } }
        若 key_down("x") { 令 cam_dist = cam_dist + 3.0   若 cam_dist > 300.0 { 令 cam_dist = 300.0 } }

        # ── Draw maze walls ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        set_color(80, 120, 160)

        # Outer boundary
        draw_line_3d(-150.0, -100.0, -150.0, -150.0, 100.0, -150.0)
        draw_line_3d(-150.0, -100.0, 150.0, -150.0, 100.0, 150.0)
        draw_line_3d(150.0, -100.0, -150.0, 150.0, 100.0, -150.0)
        draw_line_3d(150.0, -100.0, 150.0, 150.0, 100.0, 150.0)

        draw_line_3d(-150.0, -100.0, -150.0, 150.0, -100.0, -150.0)
        draw_line_3d(-150.0, 100.0, -150.0, 150.0, 100.0, -150.0)
        draw_line_3d(-150.0, -100.0, 150.0, 150.0, -100.0, 150.0)
        draw_line_3d(-150.0, 100.0, 150.0, 150.0, 100.0, 150.0)

        # Interior walls
        set_color(100, 140, 180)
        draw_line_3d(50.0, -100.0, -60.0, 50.0, 100.0, -60.0)
        draw_line_3d(50.0, -100.0, 60.0, 50.0, 100.0, 60.0)

        draw_line_3d(-80.0, -100.0, -100.0, -80.0, 100.0, -100.0)
        draw_line_3d(-80.0, -100.0, 0.0, -80.0, 100.0, 0.0)

        draw_line_3d(-100.0, -100.0, -40.0, 80.0, -100.0, -40.0)
        draw_line_3d(-100.0, 100.0, -40.0, 80.0, 100.0, -40.0)

        draw_line_3d(100.0, -100.0, 0.0, 100.0, 100.0, 0.0)
        draw_line_3d(100.0, -100.0, 120.0, 100.0, 100.0, 120.0)

        # ── Draw ball ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        令 hue = 0.62 - hNorm * 0.55
        ลายจักร(bx, by, bz, 1,0,0, 0,1,0, R, 7, FR * 0.04, hue)

        # ── Shadow ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        set_color(0, 30, 60)
        draw_line_3d(bx - R, -100.0, bz, bx + R, -100.0, bz)
        draw_line_3d(bx, -100.0, bz - R, bx, -100.0, bz + R)

        set_color(40, 90, 140)
        draw_line_3d(bx, by, bz, bx, -100.0, bz)

        # ── Velocity arrow ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        set_color(230, 60, 40)
        draw_line_3d(bx, by, bz, bx + vx * 0.08, by + vy * 0.08, bz + vz * 0.08)

        # ── Charge meter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        若 charge > 0.01 {
            令 cf = charge / MAX_CHARGE
            set_color(255, int(200 - cf * 180.0), 40)
            draw_line_3d(bx, by, bz, bx, by - cf * 5.0, bz)
            draw_line_3d(bx - 1.5, by - cf * 5.0, bz, bx + 1.5, by - cf * 5.0, bz)
        }

        แสดงผล()
        令 FR = FR + 1
    }
}
